==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|SM Promo|Moltres|143}}, one of the {{TCG|SM Black Star Promos}}.
**Both cards have {{m|Sky Attack}}; this is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Moltres}} can learn.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Moltres}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

